WEBVTT

00:13:59.138 --> 00:14:02.306
and that decline in trust in leaders.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.986
What is authentic? What is real?

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:08.966
What is true and therefore
worthy of trust?

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.892
AG: Early in her own career,
when she first started teaching,

00:14:11.916 --> 00:14:13.806
Herminia struggled with authenticity.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.966
HI: I did really poorly
for a number of years,

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.926
and everybody was giving me advice
about what to do,

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:22.696
and of course nothing fit.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:27.076
And what I was struck with
was the least helpful feedback

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:30.096
was, "Just be yourself, Herminia."